    "pregnancy": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب خطر مشخصی برای بارداری ذکر نکرده یا داده کافی ندارد؛ فقط در صورت لزوم و با نظر پزشک.",
        "en": "Label states no clear risk or has limited data; use only if needed, under medical advice."
      },
      "quote": "There are no adequate and well controlled studies in pregnant women. pentoxifylline extended-release tablet should be used during pregnancy only if the potential benefit justifies the potential risk to the fetus.",
